WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Three brands tied.
First choice split.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.700
In RecoScope’s November 23
wireless-earbuds snapshot,

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.700
Apple, Beats and Sony

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.050
each appeared in 9 of 12 answers.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.100
But the overall rankings
told a different story.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.100
ChatGPT and Perplexity
ranked Sony first.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.750
Claude and Gemini
ranked Beats first.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.750
Apple had no first place
in those overall lists.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.750
But Perplexity moved it to first
specifically for iPhone users.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.100
We captured 12 usable answers

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.200
from four AI assistants
across three prompt types,

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.600
using the same commuter-and-gym profile.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.800
Soundcore appeared in all four
under-$150 answers.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.600
Mentions don’t verify checkout prices.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.550
For your brand, track mentions,
overall ranks

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.200
and shopper conditions separately.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.400
These captured answers
don’t establish product quality.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:52.333
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
